Hi,

Below is a note from Jerry Thrasher (PWG Chair, Lexmark) about discussion
of a project to create an SNMP-to-CIM proxy (i.e., a CIM Provider) at the PWG
PWG face-to-face meeting next week in Boulder, CO.

The slides were written by Bill Wagner (WIMS-CIM WG Chair, TIC) and provide
excellent detailed background and pose a number of relevant questions.

If you are interested in this SNMP-to-CIM project, then please review
Bill's slides.
If you have comments, please reply to this note and I'll forward your comments
to the PWG for inclusion in our discussion on Wednesday 25 June.

Cheers,
- Ira


